        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Campus energy - where it goes and what we could save.** Figures for the last full year (2016) use the university tariff and UK carbon factors (editable reference data). Readings flagged as faulty meters are excluded. Use *Building* above to focus on specific buildings."
