      "title": "Energy intensity vs similar buildings (electricity)",
      "description": "Electricity use per m² of floor area compared with the median building of the same use. +50% means half as much again as a typical building. Very high values can also indicate a sub-meter serving more than one building - check with the metering contractor.",
      "datasource": {
